  "changes": [
    "First version. A page plus its host service; no gateway, provider or agent hook.",
    "The host part reads .codex-global-state.json, state-backups/ and magpie's providers.json / plugins.json, and calls magpie's /v1/magpie/quotas; permissions stays empty because the page itself reads no magpie resource.",
    "Restore keeps the replaced file in state-backups/pre-restore-<time> and refuses a snapshot that is itself a signed-out copy."
  ]
